    "profiles": {
      "viajante": {
        "label": "Viajante",
        "cards": [
          {
            "id": "atol-bikini-viajante-P01",
            "factKey": "atol-bikini-F01",
            "text": "Um anel de pequenas ilhas de coral cerca uma laguna oval no meio do Pacífico.",
            "relatedFields": [
              "C1"
            ],
            "sources": [
              "BIKINI_BRIT"
            ],
            "clueType": "paisagem",
            "signalStrength": "abertura",
            "recommendedMoment": "early",
            "importance": "relevant",
            "twoPlayerSuitable": true
          },
          {
            "id": "atol-bikini-viajante-P02",
            "factKey": "atol-bikini-F02",
            "text": "Fica no Pacífico central, num país formado por dezenas de atóis.",
            "relatedFields": [
              "C1"
            ],
            "sources": [
              "BIKINI_BRIT",
              "BIKINI_BKA"
            ],
            "clueType": "localizacao",
            "signalStrength": "abertura",
            "recommendedMoment": "early",
            "importance": "relevant",
            "twoPlayerSuitable": true
          },
          {
            "id": "atol-bikini-viajante-P03",
            "factKey": "atol-bikini-F03",
            "text": "Apesar da imagem de paraíso tropical tranquilo, o lugar marca o começo da era nuclear.",
            "relatedFields": [
              "C1"
            ],
            "sources": [
              "BIKINI_UNESCO",
              "BIKINI_UNESCO_DEC"
            ],
            "clueType": "historia",
            "signalStrength": "conexao",
            "recommendedMoment": "middle",
            "importance": "relevant",
            "twoPlayerSuitable": true
          },
          {
            "id": "atol-bikini-viajante-P04",
            "factKey": "atol-bikini-F04",
            "text": "Depois da Segunda Guerra Mundial, os Estados Unidos escolheram este atol para testar bombas atômicas.",
            "relatedFields": [
              "C1",
              "C2"
            ],
            "sources": [
              "BIKINI_UNESCO_DEC",
              "BIKINI_BRIT"
            ],
            "clueType": "historia",
            "signalStrength": "conexao",
            "recommendedMoment": "middle",
            "importance": "relevant",
            "twoPlayerSuitable": true
          },
          {
            "id": "atol-bikini-viajante-P05",
            "factKey": "atol-bikini-F05",
            "text": "Antes dos testes, um oficial da Marinha americana pediu aos moradores que deixassem o atol \"para o bem da humanidade\".",
            "relatedFields": [
              "C3"
            ],
            "sources": [
              "BIKINI_AHF"
            ],
            "clueType": "historia",
            "signalStrength": "conexao",
            "recommendedMoment": "middle",
            "importance": "relevant",
            "twoPlayerSuitable": true
          },
          {
            "id": "atol-bikini-viajante-P06",
            "factKey": "atol-bikini-F06",
            "text": "Primeiro, os moradores foram levados para um atol vizinho, a cerca de 200 km dali.",
            "relatedFields": [
              "C3"
            ],
            "sources": [
              "BIKINI_AHF"
            ],
            "clueType": "historia",
            "signalStrength": "conexao",
            "recommendedMoment": "middle",
            "importance": "relevant",
            "twoPlayerSuitable": true
          },
          {
            "id": "atol-bikini-viajante-P07",
            "factKey": "atol-bikini-F07",
            "text": "Em 1948, depois de viver em barracas em outro atol, a comunidade foi levada para uma ilha pequena e sem laguna.",
            "relatedFields": [
              "C3"
            ],
            "sources": [
              "BIKINI_BKA"
            ],
            "clueType": "historia",
            "signalStrength": "conexao",
            "recommendedMoment": "middle",
            "importance": "relevant",
            "twoPlayerSuitable": true
          },
          {
            "id": "atol-bikini-viajante-P08",
            "factKey": "atol-bikini-F08",
            "text": "A ilha onde a comunidade foi instalada fica a cerca de 800 km a sudeste do atol.",
            "relatedFields": [
              "C3"
            ],
            "sources": [
              "BIKINI_BRIT"
            ],
            "clueType": "localizacao",
            "signalStrength": "conexao",
            "recommendedMoment": "middle",
            "importance": "relevant",
            "twoPlayerSuitable": true
          },
          {
            "id": "atol-bikini-viajante-P09",
            "factKey": "atol-bikini-F09",
            "text": "O primeiro teste, em 1º de julho de 1946, usou uma bomba de 20 quilotons.",
            "relatedFields": [
              "C2"
            ],
            "sources": [
              "BIKINI_BRIT",
              "BIKINI_AHF"
            ],
            "clueType": "historia",
            "signalStrength": "conexao",
            "recommendedMoment": "middle",
            "importance": "relevant",
            "twoPlayerSuitable": true
          },
          {
            "id": "atol-bikini-viajante-P10",
            "factKey": "atol-bikini-F10",
            "text": "Em 25 de julho de 1946 aconteceu aqui a primeira explosão atômica debaixo d’água.",
            "relatedFields": [
              "C2"
            ],
            "sources": [
              "BIKINI_BRIT",
              "BIKINI_AHF"
            ],
            "clueType": "historia",
            "signalStrength": "conexao",
            "recommendedMoment": "middle",
            "importance": "relevant",
            "twoPlayerSuitable": true
          },
          {
            "id": "atol-bikini-viajante-P11",
            "factKey": "atol-bikini-F11",
            "text": "A série de testes de 1946 mobilizou 242 navios, 156 aviões e mais de 42 mil pessoas da equipe americana.",
            "relatedFields": [
              "C2"
            ],
            "sources": [
              "BIKINI_BKA"
            ],
            "clueType": "historia",
            "signalStrength": "conexao",
            "recommendedMoment": "middle",
            "importance": "relevant",
            "twoPlayerSuitable": true
          },
          {
            "id": "atol-bikini-viajante-P12",
            "factKey": "atol-bikini-F12",
            "text": "Navios afundados nos testes de 1946 continuam no fundo da laguna.",
            "relatedFields": [
              "C2"
            ],
            "sources": [
              "BIKINI_UNESCO"
            ],
            "clueType": "agua",
            "signalStrength": "conexao",
            "recommendedMoment": "middle",
            "importance": "relevant",
            "twoPlayerSuitable": true
          },
          {
            "id": "atol-bikini-viajante-P13",
            "factKey": "atol-bikini-F13",
            "text": "Os naufrágios atraem mergulhadores: o turismo de mergulho começou nos anos 1990.",
            "relatedFields": [
              "C1"
            ],
            "sources": [
              "BIKINI_BKA",
              "BIKINI_UNESCO_DEC"
            ],
            "clueType": "cultura",
            "signalStrength": "conexao",
            "recommendedMoment": "middle",
            "importance": "relevant",
            "twoPlayerSuitable": true
          },
          {
            "id": "atol-bikini-viajante-P14",
            "factKey": "atol-bikini-F14",
            "text": "Em 1º de março de 1954, aqui explodiu a bomba mais potente já testada pelos Estados Unidos.",
            "relatedFields": [
              "C4"
            ],
            "sources": [
              "BIKINI_AHF"
            ],
            "clueType": "historia",
            "signalStrength": "conexao",
            "recommendedMoment": "middle",
            "importance": "relevant",
            "twoPlayerSuitable": true
          },
          {
            "id": "atol-bikini-viajante-P15",
            "factKey": "atol-bikini-F15",
            "text": "A bomba de 1954 foi mais de mil vezes mais potente que a de Hiroshima.",
            "relatedFields": [
              "C4"
            ],
            "sources": [
              "BIKINI_AHF"
            ],
            "clueType": "historia",
            "signalStrength": "conexao",
            "recommendedMoment": "middle",
            "importance": "relevant",
            "twoPlayerSuitable": true
          },
          {
            "id": "atol-bikini-viajante-P16",
            "factKey": "atol-bikini-F16",
            "text": "Uma cratera gigante deixada por um teste ainda marca o atol.",
            "relatedFields": [
              "C4"
            ],
            "sources": [
              "BIKINI_UNESCO"
            ],
            "clueType": "relevo",
            "signalStrength": "conexao",
            "recommendedMoment": "middle",
            "importance": "relevant",
            "twoPlayerSuitable": true
          },
          {
            "id": "atol-bikini-viajante-P17",
            "factKey": "atol-bikini-F17",
            "text": "A chuva radioativa do teste de 1954 atingiu atóis vizinhos, e os moradores de lá sofreram queimaduras.",
            "relatedFields": [
              "C4"
            ],
            "sources": [
              "BIKINI_AHF"
            ],
            "clueType": "historia",
            "signalStrength": "conexao",
            "recommendedMoment": "middle",
            "importance": "relevant",
            "twoPlayerSuitable": true
          },
          {
            "id": "atol-bikini-viajante-P18",
            "factKey": "atol-bikini-F18",
            "text": "Em 1956, a primeira bomba de hidrogênio lançada de um avião americano explodiu aqui.",
            "relatedFields": [
              "C1"
            ],
            "sources": [
              "BIKINI_BRIT"
            ],
            "clueType": "historia",
            "signalStrength": "conexao",
            "recommendedMoment": "middle",
            "importance": "relevant",
            "twoPlayerSuitable": true
          },
          {
            "id": "atol-bikini-viajante-P19",
            "factKey": "atol-bikini-F19",
            "text": "Alguns moradores voltaram depois de uma limpeza, mas em 1978 tiveram de sair de novo por causa da radiação.",
            "relatedFields": [
              "C1",
              "C3"
            ],
            "sources": [
              "BIKINI_BRIT",
              "BIKINI_AHF",
              "BIKINI_BKA"
            ],
            "clueType": "historia",
            "signalStrength": "conexao",
            "recommendedMoment": "middle",
            "importance": "relevant",
            "twoPlayerSuitable": true
          },
          {
            "id": "atol-bikini-viajante-P20",
            "factKey": "atol-bikini-F20",
            "text": "Foi o primeiro lugar do seu país a entrar na lista do Patrimônio Mundial.",
            "relatedFields": [
              "C1"
            ],
            "sources": [
              "BIKINI_UNESCO",
              "BIKINI_UNESCO_NEWS"
            ],
            "clueType": "patrimonio",
            "signalStrength": "conexao",
            "recommendedMoment": "middle",
            "importance": "relevant",
            "twoPlayerSuitable": true
          },
          {
            "id": "atol-bikini-viajante-P21",
            "factKey": "atol-bikini-F21",
            "text": "Antes da Segunda Guerra Mundial, o atol também era conhecido como \"Atol Escholtz\".",
            "relatedFields": [
              "C1"
            ],
            "sources": [
              "BIKINI_BRIT"
            ],
            "clueType": "historia",
            "signalStrength": "conexao",
            "recommendedMoment": "middle",
            "importance": "relevant",
            "twoPlayerSuitable": true
          },
          {
            "id": "atol-bikini-viajante-P22",
            "factKey": "atol-bikini-F22",
            "text": "Até hoje a presença humana aqui é muito limitada por causa da radioatividade.",
            "relatedFields": [
              "C1"
            ],
            "sources": [
              "BIKINI_UNESCO_DEC"
            ],
            "clueType": "historia",
            "signalStrength": "conexao",
            "recommendedMoment": "middle",
            "importance": "relevant",
            "twoPlayerSuitable": true
          },
          {
            "id": "atol-bikini-viajante-P23",
            "factKey": "atol-bikini-F23",
            "text": "Entre 1946 e 1958, foram feitos aqui 23 testes nucleares.",
            "relatedFields": [
              "C1"
            ],
            "sources": [
              "BIKINI_UNESCO_DEC",
              "BIKINI_AHF"
            ],
            "clueType": "historia",
            "signalStrength": "conexao",
            "recommendedMoment": "middle",
            "importance": "relevant",
            "twoPlayerSuitable": true
          },
          {
            "id": "atol-bikini-viajante-P24",
            "factKey": "atol-bikini-F24",
            "text": "Virou Patrimônio Mundial da UNESCO em 2010, numa reunião do Comitê realizada em Brasília.",
            "relatedFields": [
              "C1"
            ],
            "sources": [
              "BIKINI_UNESCO_NEWS",
              "BIKINI_UNESCO_DEC"
            ],
            "clueType": "patrimonio",
            "signalStrength": "decisiva",
            "recommendedMoment": "late",
            "importance": "relevant",
            "twoPlayerSuitable": true
          },
          {
            "id": "atol-bikini-viajante-P25",
            "factKey": "atol-bikini-F25",
            "text": "Fica na Cadeia Ralik, das Ilhas Marshall, a cerca de 305 km a leste do atol de Enewetak.",
            "relatedFields": [
              "C1"
            ],
            "sources": [
              "BIKINI_BRIT"
            ],
            "clueType": "localizacao",
            "signalStrength": "decisiva",
            "recommendedMoment": "late",
            "importance": "relevant",
            "twoPlayerSuitable": true
          }
        ]
      },
      "geografo": {
        "label": "Geógrafo",
        "cards": [
          {
            "id": "atol-bikini-geografo-P01",
            "factKey": "atol-bikini-F26",
            "text": "É um atol: ilhotas baixas de coral, em média só uns 2 m acima da maré baixa, em volta de uma laguna.",
            "relatedFields": [
              "C1"
            ],
            "sources": [
              "BIKINI_BRIT"
            ],
            "clueType": "relevo",
            "signalStrength": "abertura",
            "recommendedMoment": "early",
            "importance": "relevant",
            "twoPlayerSuitable": true
          },
          {
            "id": "atol-bikini-geografo-P02",
            "factKey": "atol-bikini-F02",
            "text": "Fica no Pacífico central, num arquipélago de 29 atóis e 5 ilhas espalhados por uma imensa área oceânica.",
            "relatedFields": [
              "C1"
            ],
            "sources": [
              "BIKINI_BKA"
            ],
            "clueType": "localizacao",
            "signalStrength": "abertura",
            "recommendedMoment": "early",
            "importance": "relevant",
            "twoPlayerSuitable": true
          },
          {
            "id": "atol-bikini-geografo-P03",
            "factKey": "atol-bikini-F27",
            "text": "A laguna oval mede cerca de 40 km de comprimento por 24 km de largura.",
            "relatedFields": [
              "C1"
            ],
            "sources": [
              "BIKINI_BRIT"
            ],
            "clueType": "agua",
            "signalStrength": "conexao",
            "recommendedMoment": "middle",
            "importance": "relevant",
            "twoPlayerSuitable": true
          },
          {
            "id": "atol-bikini-geografo-P04",
            "factKey": "atol-bikini-F28",
            "text": "Está a cerca de 360 km a noroeste do atol de Kwajalein.",
            "relatedFields": [
              "C1"
            ],
            "sources": [
              "BIKINI_BRIT"
            ],
            "clueType": "localizacao",
            "signalStrength": "conexao",
            "recommendedMoment": "middle",
            "importance": "relevant",
            "twoPlayerSuitable": true
          },
          {
            "id": "atol-bikini-geografo-P05",
            "factKey": "atol-bikini-F23",
            "text": "Entre 1946 e 1958, os EUA fizeram 67 testes nucleares no arquipélago: 23 neste atol e 44 perto de Enewetak.",
            "relatedFields": [
              "C1"
            ],
            "sources": [
              "BIKINI_AHF",
              "BIKINI_UNESCO_DEC"
            ],
            "clueType": "historia",
            "signalStrength": "conexao",
            "recommendedMoment": "middle",
            "importance": "relevant",
            "twoPlayerSuitable": true
          },
          {
            "id": "atol-bikini-geografo-P06",
            "factKey": "atol-bikini-F29",
            "text": "A força somada dos testes no arquipélago equivale a 7 mil bombas de Hiroshima.",
            "relatedFields": [
              "C1"
            ],
            "sources": [
              "BIKINI_UNESCO_DEC",
              "BIKINI_UNESCO"
            ],
            "clueType": "processo",
            "signalStrength": "conexao",
            "recommendedMoment": "middle",
            "importance": "relevant",
            "twoPlayerSuitable": true
          },
          {
            "id": "atol-bikini-geografo-P07",
            "factKey": "atol-bikini-F30",
            "text": "Foi inscrito pelos critérios (iv) e (vi), como exemplo excepcional de local de testes nucleares e símbolo da era nuclear.",
            "relatedFields": [
              "C1"
            ],
            "sources": [
              "BIKINI_UNESCO_DEC"
            ],
            "clueType": "patrimonio",
            "signalStrength": "conexao",
            "recommendedMoment": "middle",
            "importance": "relevant",
            "twoPlayerSuitable": true
          },
          {
            "id": "atol-bikini-geografo-P08",
            "factKey": "atol-bikini-F31",
            "text": "As ideias ligadas a este lugar e à corrida armamentista inspiraram movimentos pelo desarmamento nuclear.",
            "relatedFields": [
              "C1"
            ],
            "sources": [
              "BIKINI_UNESCO_DEC"
            ],
            "clueType": "patrimonio",
            "signalStrength": "conexao",
            "recommendedMoment": "middle",
            "importance": "relevant",
            "twoPlayerSuitable": true
          },
          {
            "id": "atol-bikini-geografo-P09",
            "factKey": "atol-bikini-F32",
            "text": "Restos militares convivem com uma \"recomposição natural\" das paisagens terrestres e submarinas.",
            "relatedFields": [
              "C1"
            ],
            "sources": [
              "BIKINI_UNESCO_DEC"
            ],
            "clueType": "processo",
            "signalStrength": "conexao",
            "recommendedMoment": "middle",
            "importance": "relevant",
            "twoPlayerSuitable": true
          },
          {
            "id": "atol-bikini-geografo-P10",
            "factKey": "atol-bikini-F22",
            "text": "Os radionuclídeos limitaram muito a presença humana, e por isso o sítio não passou por reconstruções.",
            "relatedFields": [
              "C1"
            ],
            "sources": [
              "BIKINI_UNESCO_DEC"
            ],
